        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/def60b869924d543d147ae71ecb1a069.avif?t=1777904169\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.poster.avif?t=1777904169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.webm?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.mp4?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land once flowing with milk and honey, resources suddenly began to run out. Sensing the impending end of the world as they knew it, the three heroes embark on a journey through unknown lands to uncover the mystery behind this life-sustaining energy crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat your foes in tactical, turn-based battles set on a hexagonal grid</strong>. Lead a party of cartoon heroes - the brave bean explorer, the fluffy cat defender, and the onion musician from distant realm - through a series of adventures in Whimsical Heroes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight diverse tactical turn-based battles</strong> - Engage in a variety of combat scenarios with a wide range of characters, bosses, traps, special objects, reinforcement, and events at crucial moments in battle that make each encounter unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a party of Whimsical Heroes</strong> - Each hero has a unique set of skills and roles within the team, offering exciting tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet allies and new companions</strong> - Companions will join your Camp, allowing you to expand it with new structures and providing powerful skills in next battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your camp</strong> - Your Camp is a safe haven for your heroes, where you can develop your characters and unlock other rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Influence the fate of your expedition</strong> - The world of Whimsical Heroes isn't just about battles. It also features special events that require decision-making, sometimes leading to the discovery of new secret places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the unique artistic style</strong> - Immerse yourself in a world filled with cats, cheeky cucumbers, talented onions, and various other whimsical creatures. Explore what the world of Whimsical Heroes has to offer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.poster.avif?t=1777904169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.webm?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.mp4?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Adventure Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the game's narrative, that allows you to explore the game mechanics and learn about the fates of the main characters and the entire land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode (Inspired by Roguelike systems)</strong>: Choose three heroes and travel through a land that looks different with each playthrough. Heroes will acquire new skills and encounter various characters, offering fresh challenges every time you play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, which means it is still being developed. In the coming months, we plan to add new content and features, as well as fix bugs and improve overall gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version of the game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30</strong> unique scenes of the first chapter of the Story Mode, which gives you about 2-3 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>29</strong> different scenes with randomly generated encounters and Events in the Adventure Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> various active and passive skills for your characters to use in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10</strong> original enemy types, such as flying Beenut, mighty Cucumberbatch or pumpkin witch Baba-Yaga</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> Heroes - fluffy Cat, onion Bard and brave Beanling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> Companions - famous travelling Cook, apple connoisseur Hedgehog and nimble Bird</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.poster.avif?t=1777904169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.webm?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.mp4?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land once flowing with milk and honey, resources suddenly began to run out. Sensing the impending end of the world as they knew it, the three heroes embark on a journey through unknown lands to uncover the mystery behind this life-sustaining energy crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat your foes in tactical, turn-based battles set on a hexagonal grid</strong>. Lead a party of cartoon heroes - the brave bean explorer, the fluffy cat defender, and the onion musician from distant realm - through a series of adventures in Whimsical Heroes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight diverse tactical turn-based battles</strong> - Engage in a variety of combat scenarios with a wide range of characters, bosses, traps, special objects, reinforcement, and events at crucial moments in battle that make each encounter unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a party of Whimsical Heroes</strong> - Each hero has a unique set of skills and roles within the team, offering exciting tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet allies and new companions</strong> - Companions will join your Camp, allowing you to expand it with new structures and providing powerful skills in next battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your camp</strong> - Your Camp is a safe haven for your heroes, where you can develop your characters and unlock other rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Influence the fate of your expedition</strong> - The world of Whimsical Heroes isn't just about battles. It also features special events that require decision-making, sometimes leading to the discovery of new secret places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the unique artistic style</strong> - Immerse yourself in a world filled with cats, cheeky cucumbers, talented onions, and various other whimsical creatures. Explore what the world of Whimsical Heroes has to offer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.poster.avif?t=1777904169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.webm?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.mp4?t=1777904169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Adventure Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the game's narrative, that allows you to explore the game mechanics and learn about the fates of the main characters and the entire land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode (Inspired by Roguelike systems)</strong>: Choose three heroes and travel through a land that looks different with each playthrough. Heroes will acquire new skills and encounter various characters, offering fresh challenges every time you play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, which means it is still being developed. In the coming months, we plan to add new content and features, as well as fix bugs and improve overall gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version of the game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30</strong> unique scenes of the first chapter of the Story Mode, which gives you about 2-3 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>29</strong> different scenes with randomly generated encounters and Events in the Adventure Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> various active and passive skills for your characters to use in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10</strong> original enemy types, such as flying Beenut, mighty Cucumberbatch or pumpkin witch Baba-Yaga</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> Heroes - fluffy Cat, onion Bard and brave Beanling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> Companions - famous travelling Cook, apple connoisseur Hedgehog and nimble Bird</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Gather your party, set up camp, and step into a fantasy world brimming with silly creatures, unexpected allies, and strategic turn-based battles. You’ll grow your team of heroes, master and learn new skills, and meet tons of adorable characters along the way.",
